.TH DUNGEN 1
.SH NAME
dungen \- dungeon crawl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/dungen
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I DunGen
is a dungeon crawl.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Move with wasd or the arrows in a first-person dungeon. Press space then a direction to attack. Kill every monster.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move (or attack direction after space)
.TP
.B space
Enter attack mode (then arrow)
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/dungen.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
